groups.stimulus:
Consider the following cascading style sheet (CSS) code fragment for a website.

```
body {
    font-size: 100%;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-weight: normal;
}
h1 {
    text-align: center;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 250%;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    background-color: rgb(0, 0, 100);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 900;
    border: 3px solid green;
}
```
